                     </biblList>
                  </event>
               </eventList>
               <p xml:id="idm124">The poet Christian Winther published his verse epos "Hjortens Flugt" in november 1855, the main figure, Folmer Spillemand, allegedly being a self portrait of the author. The work rapidly became a success, and shortly afterwards Hartmann made a selection of the verse epos to which he composed music.</p>
            </history>
